.TH KURVENRAUSCH 6 @PROJECT_DATE@ "kurvenrausch @PROJECT_VERSION_FULL@" "Games"
.SH NAME
kurvenrausch \- classic pseudo-3D arcade racer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kurvenrausch
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kurvenrausch
is a racer in the spirit of OutRun and Lotus Esprit Turbo Challenge: one lap
around the world, from the Cote d'Azur through England, the Netherlands, the
Black Forest, the Alps and Tuscany to Arizona, the California coast, San
Francisco and Japan.
The road forks in places into two routes that join again; keep to the side of
the road you want to take.
On the way there is traffic to pass, fuel to buy at gas stations, other cars
to choose at car dealers (stop on the forecourt and steer left or right),
nitro to burn and, in San Francisco, crests to jump.
.PP
Without options the game opens a window and starts at the start line; the lap
clock runs from the first time the car crosses it.
With
.B \-\-screenshot
it runs headless instead: an autopilot drives for the given number of steps,
one frame is rendered and saved, and no window is opened.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot " FILE"
Render headless and save the frame as a BMP image to
.IR FILE ,
then exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-frames " N"
Simulate
.I N
steps (60 per second) before the screenshot.
The default is 0.
.TP
.BI \-\-position " Z"
Start the headless run at distance
.I Z
along the track.
.TP
.BI \-\-zone " N"
Start the headless run inside zone
.IR N ;
see
.BR \-\-print\-zones .
.TP
.B \-\-print\-zones
List the zones of the track with their segments and start positions, then
exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-wav " FILE"
Also write the sound of the headless run as a WAV file.
Needs
.BR \-\-screenshot .
.TP
.BI \-\-steer " S"
Hold the steering at
.I S
(\-1 left to 1 right) instead of letting the autopilot steer.
.TP
.BI \-\-steer\-from " N"
Start holding the steering only at step
.IR N .
The default is 0.
.TP
.B \-\-horn
Hold the horn during the headless run.
.TP
.BI \-\-nitro " N"
Press nitro at step
.I N
of the headless run.
.TP
.BI \-\-fuel " L"
Start the headless run with
.I L
(0 to 1) of a tank.
.TP
.BI \-\-car " N"
Drive car model
.I N
in the headless run: 0 Spider, 1 GT Coupe, 2 Hot Hatch, 3 Muscle.
.TP
.B \-\-dealer
Let the autopilot pull in at the next car dealer during the headless run, and
stay there.
.TP
.BI \-\-icon " FILE"
Write the application icon (32\(mu32 pixels) as a BMP image to
.IR FILE ,
then exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print a summary of the options and exit.
.SH CONTROLS
.TS
l l l.
Keyboard	Gamepad	Action
\(ua or W	right trigger, A	accelerate
\(da or S	left trigger, B	brake
\(<- \(-> or A D	left stick, D-pad	steer
H	X, left shoulder	horn
Space	Y, right shoulder	nitro
R	Start	restart
M		mute the sound
F11, Alt+Enter		toggle fullscreen
Esc		quit
.TE
.PP
Any game controller SDL knows works and can be plugged in at any time.
Sticks and triggers are analog; keyboard and gamepad can be used together.
The pad rumbles on crashes, scraping a barrier, close passes, nitro and when
leaving the road.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SDL_GAMECONTROLLERCONFIG
Additional game controller mappings, in SDL's format.
.TP
.BR SDL_VIDEODRIVER ", " SDL_AUDIODRIVER
Select SDL's video and audio drivers, for example
.B dummy
to run without a display or sound device.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 1 if the window could not be opened, an option is unknown,
incomplete or needs
.B \-\-screenshot
with it, or a file could not be written.
.SH EXAMPLES
Render the start of the Tuscany zone after two and a half seconds:
.PP
.EX
kurvenrausch \-\-screenshot shot.bmp \-\-zone 3 \-\-frames 150
.EE
.PP
Record most of a lap with its sound:
.PP
.EX
kurvenrausch \-\-screenshot shot.bmp \-\-frames 9000 \-\-wav lap.wav
.EE
